面与浅色柜体。左侧橘色小猫身着粉色蕾丝花边连衣裙，胸前系有粉色蝴蝶结，嘴巴微张呈说话状；右侧虎斑小猫穿着蓝色波点背带裤，背带裤上有白色纽扣装饰。两只小猫头部相对，眼神对视，桌面上清晰映出它们的倒影。画面下方显示中文文字“三乘以七等于几”。  \n\n[1.0秒] 两只小猫头部转向不同方向，左侧橘色小猫将头转向右侧，右侧虎斑小猫将头转向左侧，两者不再对视。橘色小猫的嘴巴闭合，虎斑小猫的头部姿态也发生明显变化，整体画面呈现小猫注意力转移的状态，桌面倒影依然清晰。画面下方文字“三乘以七等于几”依旧可见。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 139, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "title": "结果", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [555.6688232421875, 1094.4920654296875], "pos": [640.526611328125, 675.5591430664062], "id": 86, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [233.46487426757812, 82], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [1217.26171875, 687.1163330078125], "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 141, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_cache"}, "name": "purge_cache", "label": "purge_cache", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_cache"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_models"}, "name": "purge_models", "label": "purge_models", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_models"}], "flags": {}, "id": 113, "type": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: PurgeVRAM"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [139, 141, 142], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [400, 396], "pos": [225.84317016601562, 681.8765869140625], "widgets_values": ["描述一下这段视频内容，同时描述视频里每个分镜出现的时间及视频主体内容。请直接输出结果。", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Thinking", 0.7, 0.8, 2048, 262144, 786432, "8bit", "eager", 99655971926331, "randomize", 2048, false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "